› what can I press here
Every key, grouped by context.
[info] idle     Enter send · Shift+Tab mode cycle · @ file · / command · ? help · Shift+Enter
newline · Alt+Enter newline · Ctrl+Enter newline · Ctrl+R history · Ctrl+T thinking · Ctrl+O
transcript · Ctrl+E expand · Ctrl+G diff · Ctrl+C quit · Ctrl+D quit · y copy · Shift+Y copy all
       running  Esc interrupt · Ctrl+C interrupt · Ctrl+B background · Ctrl+O transcript · Alt+Enter
        send now · Ctrl+Enter send now · Ctrl+U unqueue
       modal    Enter choose · Esc close · Up previous · Down next
       overlay  Esc close · ? close · PageUp scroll up · PageDown scroll down
       /model [cheap|code|think] [model]                        switch a tier's model
       /think <prompt>                                          one turn on the think tier, price
       confirmed first
       /effort [low|high|xhigh]                                 effort for the rest of the session;
       bare restores the tier default
       /compact [focus]                                         compact the context now
       /rewind                                                  go back to an earlier turn: code,
       conversation or both
       /undo                                                    undo the last turn's file changes
       /redo                                                    redo what /undo took back
       /cost                                                    what this session has spent
       /context                                                 where the next request's tokens go
       /autocompact                                             the compaction threshold and its
       config source
       /permissions [default|plan|auto|bypass]                  show or set the permission mode
       /sandbox <read-only|workspace-write|danger-full-access>  set the sandbox mode
       /resume                                                  pick an earlier session to resume
       /sessions                                                this project's recent sessions
       /expand <id>                                             show an archived tool output in full
       /agents                                                  live cox sessions in this workspace
       /loop <interval> <prompt> [--budget usd] | /loop stop    repeat a prompt on a timer with its
       own budget cap
       /skills                                                  list skills
       /hooks                                                   list hooks
       /mcp                                                     MCP servers and their tools
       /doctor                                                  check the install
       /clear                                                   new session, same directory
       /fork [turn]                                             new child session with the history
       up to a turn (default: all)
       /handoff <objective>                                     new child session seeded with a
       cheap summary and the objective
       /init [--force]                                          scaffold AGENTS.md for this repo
       /todo                                                    toggle the todo panel
       /tasks                                                   list running background tasks
       /vim                                                     toggle vim keys
       /theme [name]                                            pick a colour theme, previewed live
       /help                                                    this list
       /quit                                                    exit













